    "text": "The dark purple colour of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>KMnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> disappears in the titration with oxalic acid in acidic medium. The overall change in the oxidation number of manganese in the reaction is",
